  "description": {

    "en": "Yonex REXIS Activate is a premium nylon multifilament built around exceptional comfort and ball pocketing. It is designed for players of all swing speeds who want a soft, arm-friendly response with excellent feel and control. The string offers outstanding shock absorption while maintaining stable tension and a predictable response, making it ideal for players transitioning from natural gut or recovering from arm discomfort.",

    "zh": "Yonex REXIS Activate 是 Yonex REXIS 系列中最强调 Ball Pocketing 与 Arm Friendly 的高端多股线。官方定位为适合所有挥拍速度，能够提供非常柔和的击球感、优秀的包球感以及极佳的舒适性。相比聚酯线，它能够显著降低击球震动，非常适合追求手感、保护手臂、双打、以及从天然肠线或 Multifilament 转换的球员。"
  },

